BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 514.4884251968503577 Td
(The customer found a sharp burr on the oil-channel cross hole of 7 CNC-machined aluminum housings from lot AH-260418.) Tj
T* (The burr exceeded the agreed visual and tactile acceptance standard and could detach during assembly.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
51.0236220472441033 471.9687401574802834 Td
(D3 Containment) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 454.9608661417322537 Td
(Stopped shipment, quarantined 1,920 pieces across four related lots, introduced 100% borescope inspection, and) Tj
T* (dispatched certified replacement stock.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
51.0236220472441033 412.4411811023621226 Td
(D4 Occurrence Cause) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 395.4333070866140929 Td
(The deburring brush reached end-of-life before the scheduled replacement interval because the actual cross-hole load was) Tj
T* (higher than the interval study assumed.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
51.0236220472441033 352.9136220472440186 Td
(D4 Escape Cause) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 335.9057480314959889 Td
(Final visual inspection used top lighting only and did not include a borescope angle capable of revealing the cross-hole burr.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
51.0236220472441033 306.1419685039369369 Td
(D4 Confirmed Root Cause) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 289.1340944881889072 Td
(Inadequate brush-life control caused the burr; an insufficient final inspection angle allowed escape.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
51.0236220472441033 259.3703149606297984 Td
(D4 5-Why) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 242.3624409448817687 Td
(1. A sharp burr remained because the deburring brush no longer removed the full edge.) Tj
T* (2. The brush was used beyond its effective life for this feature.) Tj
T* (3. The replacement interval was set from nominal cycles rather than measured burr trend.) Tj
T* (4. The control plan had no burr-trend reaction limit.) Tj
T* (5. The process risk review did not connect tool wear data to the control-plan reaction plan.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
51.0236220472441033 161.5750393700786844 Td
(D5 Corrective Action) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 144.5671653543306547 Td
(Set brush replacement at 7,500 cycles, add burr-height reaction limit, and require borescope inspection of the cross hole.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
51.0236220472441033 114.8033858267715459 Td
(D6 Verification) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.137 g
51.0236220472441033 97.7955118110235162 Td
(Three consecutive production lots plus seeded-defect detection challenge.) Tj
T* (Lots AH-260503, AH-260506, and AH-260509 passed; zero burr defects in 1,440 parts and all seeded defects detected.) Tj
ET
